From 30e5ed13cb51eade879b553919b6270df0d60370 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: OpenWCH Phase 4 <phase4@openwch.local>
Date: Thu, 13 Aug 2026 06:40:17 +0900
Subject: [PATCH 2/7] RISC-V: add Zmmul 1.0 instruction subset

The official WCH 12.2 assembler records zmmul1p0 as an implicit subset of M, accepts the standalone Zmmul subset used by WCH multilibs, and keeps division instructions unavailable without M. Add the standard subset relation, classify multiply instructions under Zmmul, retain division under M, and update inherited attribute expectations for the new implied subset.

WCH 12.2 behavior evidence: tmp/phase4-evidence/s3-zmmul-official/ and tmp/phase4-evidence/s3-zmmul-ours/. Full RISC-V GAS regression evidence: tmp/phase4-evidence/s3-vendor-x-final/.
